        <div class="gsap-reveal" id="storyText">
            <div class="section-eyebrow"><span></span> Our Story</div>
            <h2 class="section-heading">From a side project to <em>4,000 teams</em></h2>
            <p class="section-sub">LinkFlow started as a weekend experiment after our founders spent a full week manually syncing Salesforce with a homegrown data warehouse. There had to be a better way.</p>

            <div class="story-timeline">
                <div class="timeline-item">
                    <div class="tl-dot"></div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="tl-year">2021 — London</div>
                        <div class="tl-title">Rift spotted</div>
                        <div class="tl-desc">Arjun and Fiona quit their jobs after a shared epiphany: every ops team they knew was drowning in the same disconnected-tool problem.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-item">
                    <div class="tl-dot"></div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="tl-year">2022 — Seed round</div>
                        <div class="tl-title">First 100 customers & $4M raised</div>
                        <div class="tl-desc">Word spread fast. We launched to a waitlist of 600, onboarded our first 100 teams in 6 weeks, and closed a seed round to fund the core platform.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-item">
                    <div class="tl-dot"></div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="tl-year">2023 — FluxEngine</div>
                        <div class="tl-title">AI layer ships</div>
                        <div class="tl-desc">We launched FluxEngine — the AI decision layer that reads intent, not just events. Customer NPS jumped 28 points in the quarter it launched.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="timeline-item">
                    <div class="tl-dot"></div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="tl-year">2025 — Series B</div>
                        <div class="tl-title">$42M to close the rift for every enterprise</div>
                        <div class="tl-desc">We raised our Series B to build deeper enterprise infrastructure, expand to APAC and LATAM, and grow to 340+ integrations.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="values">
    <div class="inner">
        <div class="gsap-reveal" id="valuesHeader">
            <div class="section-eyebrow"><span></span> What We Believe</div>
            <h2 class="section-heading">The principles that <em>shape everything</em></h2>
        </div>
        <div class="values-grid">
            <div class="value-card gsap-reveal" data-num="01">
                <div class="value-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z" /></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Ruthless reliability</h3>
                <p>Workflows are mission-critical infrastructure. We hold ourselves to 99.99% uptime and treat every downtime minute as a personal failure. Reliability isn't a feature — it's the foundation.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="value-card gsap-reveal" data-num="02">
                <div class="value-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2" /><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4" /><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87" /><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75" /></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>People over pipelines</h3>
                <p>Technology should amplify human judgement, not replace it. We build tools that give people back the time to think, create, and make decisions — not tools that make decisions for them.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="value-card gsap-reveal" data-num="03">
                <div class="value-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" /><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12" /><path d="M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z" /></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Radical transparency</h3>
                <p>Every workflow run is fully observable. Every pricing tier is honestly documented. We don't hide complexity behind abstraction — we make it legible so you stay in control.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="value-card gsap-reveal" data-num="04">
                <div class="value-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12" /></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Default to speed</h3>
                <p>Slow iteration is a form of disrespect to the people waiting for a solution. We ship fast, learn fast, and fix fast. Perfection is a direction, not a destination before launch.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="value-card gsap-reveal" data-num="05">
                <div class="value-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2" /><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4" /></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Security is non-negotiable</h3>
                <p>We handle sensitive data for thousands of teams. SOC 2 Type II, end-to-end encryption, and zero-trust architecture aren't checkboxes — they're the baseline we hold ourselves to from day one.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="value-card gsap-reveal" data-num="06">
                <div class="value-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3L13.5 8.5L19 10L13.5 11.5L12 17L10.5 11.5L5 10L10.5 8.5L12 3Z" /></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Genuine curiosity</h3>
                <p>The best automation ideas don't come from engineers alone — they come from listening obsessively to the people running operations at 2am. We stay close to the problem, always.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="architecture">
    <div class="inner">
        <div class="gsap-reveal" id="archHeader">
            <div class="section-eyebrow"><span></span> Engineering Excellence</div>
            <h2 class="section-heading">Architected for <em>uncompromising scale</em></h2>
        </div>

        <div class="arch-grid">
            <div class="gsap-reveal" id="archText">
                <p class="section-sub" style="margin-top:0; max-width:100%;">
                    FluxEngine isn't just an API wrapper—it is a purpose-built state execution machine engineered to eliminate execution lag across modern systems. Our runtime safely decouples systemic input fluctuations from system logic, meaning transaction heavy spikes never trigger pipeline congestion.
                </p>
                <p class="section-sub" style="max-width:100%; margin-top:1rem;">
                    By distributing event computation workflows uniformly across hybrid clusters, we secure deterministic delivery targets while processing billions of dynamic telemetry adjustments every single minute.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="arch-metrics gsap-reveal" id="archCards">
                <div class="arch-metric-card">
                    <h3>&lt; 12ms</h3>
                    <h4>P99 Global Latency</h4>
                    <p>Edge runtime nodes run distributed schedules instantly near primary software ecosystem clusters.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="arch-metric-card">
                    <h3>99.99%</h3>
                    <h4>Isolation Factor</h4>
                    <p>Fault-tolerant isolation spaces guarantee run safety, blocking cross-tenant configuration conflicts.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="arch-metric-card">
                    <h3>Zero</h3>
                    <h4>State Retain-Loss</h4>
                    <p>Continuous recovery mapping safeguards historical runtime tracking strings across sudden disconnect events.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="arch-metric-card">
                    <h3>Infinite</h3>
                    <h4>Linear Threading</h4>
                    <p>Elastic memory architecture expands horizontally dynamically during surprise enterprise demand spikes.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

